1. Project Goal
The goal is to develop an AI-powered fitness application that uses Gemini models to generate personalized workout plans based on a user's:

Fitness goal

Experience level

Available equipment

Workout schedule

Session duration

Preferences

The application will also allow users to track completed workouts and view their progress.

