3. Development Methodology
An Agile development approach is suitable for FitBuddy-AI.

Development can be divided into small iterations:

Planning
   ↓
Requirements
   ↓
Design
   ↓
Development
   ↓
Testing
   ↓
Review
   ↓
Improvement
   ↺

This makes it possible to test the Gemini integration early instead of waiting until the entire application is finished.

