8. Risk Management
Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Gemini API failure	High	Error handling and fallback
Invalid AI output	High	JSON schema validation
API key exposure	High	Store key server-side
Poor AI-generated plan	High	Carefully designed prompts and validation
Database failure	Medium	Backups and error handling
Development delays	Medium	Prioritize MVP features
UI complexity	Medium	Start with simple responsive designs

A particularly important design principle is not to blindly trust model output. The backend should validate Gemini's response before saving or displaying the workout plan.

